[
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#01-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "始計第一",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：兵者，國之大事，死生之地，存亡之道，不可不察也。故經之以五事，校之以七計"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#01-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "始計第一",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "道者，令民與上同意，可與之死，可與之生，而不畏危也。天者，陰陽、寒暑、時制也。地"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#01-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "始計第一",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "將聽吾計，用之必勝，留之；將不聽吾計，用之必敗，去之。計利以聽，乃為之勢，以佐其"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#01-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "始計第一",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "夫未戰而廟算勝者，得算多也；未戰而廟算不勝者，得算少也。多算勝，少算不勝，而況於"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡用兵之法，馳車千駟，革車千乘，帶甲十萬，千里饋糧，則內外之費，賓客之用"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "善用兵者，役不再籍，糧不三載；取用於國，因糧於敵，故軍食可足也。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "國之貧於師者遠輸，遠輸則百姓貧；近師者貴賣，貴賣則百姓財竭，財竭則急於丘役。力屈"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故智將務食於敵，食敵一鍾，當吾二十鍾；萁稈一石，當吾二十石。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故殺敵者，怒也；取敵之利者，貨也。故車戰，得車十乘以上，賞其先得者，而更其旌旗。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故兵貴勝，不貴久。故知兵之將，民之司命，國家安危之主也。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡用兵之法，全國為上，破國次之；全軍為上，破軍次之；全旅為上，破旅次之；"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故上兵伐謀，其次伐交，其次伐兵，其下攻城。攻城之法，為不得已。修櫓轒轀，具器械，"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故善用兵者，屈人之兵而非戰也，拔人之城而非攻也，毀人之國而非久也，必以全爭於天下"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故用兵之法，十則圍之，五則攻之，倍則分之，敵則能戰之，少則能守之，不若則能避之。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "夫將者，國之輔也。輔周則國必強，輔隙則國必弱。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故君之所以患於軍者三：不知軍之不可以進而謂之進，不知軍之不可以退而謂之退，是為縻"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p07",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 7
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故知勝有五：知可以戰與不可以戰者勝，識衆寡之用者勝，上下同欲者勝，以虞待不虞者勝"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p08",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 8
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故曰：知彼知己，百戰不殆；不知彼而知己，一勝一負；不知彼不知己，每戰必殆。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#04-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍形第四",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：昔之善戰者，先為不可勝，以待敵之可勝。不可勝在己，可勝在敵。故善戰者，能"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#04-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍形第四",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "不可勝者，守也；可勝者，攻也。守則不足，攻則有餘。善守者，藏於九地之下；善攻者，"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#04-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍形第四",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "見勝不過衆人之所知，非善之善者也；戰勝而天下曰善，非善之善者也。故舉秋毫不為多力"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#04-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍形第四",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "古之所謂善戰者，勝於易勝者也。故善戰者之勝也，無智名，無勇功。故其戰勝不忒。不忒"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#04-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍形第四",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "兵法：一曰度，二曰量，三曰數，四曰稱，五曰勝。地生度，度生量，量生數，數生稱，稱"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡治衆如治寡，分數是也；鬥衆如鬥寡，形名是也；三軍之衆，可使必受敵而無敗"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "凡戰者，以正合，以奇勝。故善出奇者，無窮如天地，不竭如江海。終而復始，日月是也。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "激水之疾，至於漂石者，勢也；鷙鳥之疾，至於毀折者，節也。故善戰者，其勢險，其節短"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "紛紛紜紜，鬥亂而不可亂也；渾渾沌沌，形圓而不可敗也。亂生於治，怯生於勇，弱生於強"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故善動敵者，形之，敵必從之；予之，敵必取之。以利動之，以卒待之。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故善戰者，求之於勢，不責於人，故能擇人而任勢。任勢者，其戰人也，如轉木石。木石之"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡先處戰地而待敵者佚，後處戰地而趨戰者勞。故善戰者，致人而不致於人。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "能使敵自至者，利之也；能使敵不得至者，害之也。故敵佚能勞之，飽能饑之，安能動之。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "行千里而不勞者，行於無人之地也。攻而必取者，攻其所不守也；守而必固者，守其所不攻"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "進而不可禦者，沖其虛也；退而不可追者，速而不可及也。故我欲戰，敵雖高壘深溝，不得"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故形人而我無形，則我專而敵分。我專為一，敵分為十，是以十攻其一也，則我衆而敵寡。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故知戰之地，知戰之日，則可千里而會戰；不知戰之地，不知戰之日，則左不能救右，右不"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p07",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 7
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故策之而知得失之計，作之而知動靜之理，形之而知死生之地，角之而知有餘不足之處。故"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p08",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 8
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "夫兵形象水，水之行，避高而趨下；兵之勝，避實而擊虛。水因地而制行，兵因敵而制勝。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#07-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍爭第七",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡用兵之法，將受命於君，合軍聚衆，交和而舍，莫難於軍爭。軍爭之難者，以迂"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#07-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍爭第七",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故軍爭為利，軍爭為危。舉軍而爭利，則不及；委軍而爭利，則輜重捐。是故卷甲而趨，日"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#07-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍爭第七",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故兵以詐立，以利動，以分合為變者也。故其疾如風，其徐如林，侵掠如火，不動如山，難"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#07-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍爭第七",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "《軍政》曰：「言不相聞，故為金鼓；視不相見，故為旌旗。」夫金鼓旌旗者，所以一民之"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#07-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍爭第七",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "三軍可奪氣，將軍可奪心。是故朝氣銳，晝氣惰，暮氣歸。故善用兵者，避其銳氣，擊其惰"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#07-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍爭第七",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故用兵之法，高陵勿向，背丘勿逆，佯北勿從，銳卒勿攻，餌兵勿食，歸師勿遏，圍師必闕"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#08-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九變第八",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡用兵之法，將受命於君，合軍聚眾。圮地無舍，衢地合交，絕地無留，圍地則謀"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#08-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九變第八",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "是故智者之慮，必雜於利害，雜於利而務可信也，雜於害而患可解也。是故屈諸侯者以害，"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#08-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九變第八",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故用兵之法，無恃其不來，恃吾有以待之；無恃其不攻，恃吾有所不可攻也。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#08-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九變第八",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故將有五危︰必死，可殺也﹔必生，可虜也﹔忿速，可侮也﹔廉潔，可辱也﹔愛民，可煩也"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#09-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "行軍第九",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡處軍相敵，絕山依谷，視生處高，戰隆無登，此處山之軍也。絕水必遠水，客絕"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#09-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "行軍第九",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "凡軍好高而惡下，貴陽而賤陰，養生而處實，軍無百疾，是謂必勝。丘陵堤防，必處其陽，"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#09-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "行軍第九",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "凡地有絕澗，遇天井、天牢、天羅、天陷、天隙，必亟去之，勿近也。吾遠之，敵近之；吾"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#09-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "行軍第九",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "敵近而靜者，恃其險也；遠而挑戰者，欲人之進也；其所居易者，利也；衆樹動者，來也；"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#09-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "行軍第九",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故兵非貴益多也一作「益多」，惟無武進，足以併力、料敵、取人而已。夫惟無慮而易敵者"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#09-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "行軍第九",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "卒未親附而罰之，則不服，不服則難用也。卒已親附而罰不行，則不可用也。故令之以文，"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#10-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "地形第十",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡地形有通者、有掛者、有支者、有隘者、有險者、有遠者。我可以往，彼可以來"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#10-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "地形第十",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故兵有走者、有弛者、有陷者、有崩者、有亂者、有北者。凡此六者，非天之災，將之過也"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#10-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "地形第十",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "夫地形者，兵之助也。料敵制勝，計險厄遠近，上將之道也。知此而用戰者必勝，不知此而"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#10-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "地形第十",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "視卒如嬰兒，故可以與之赴深溪；視卒如愛子，故可與之俱死。厚而不能使，愛而不能令，"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#10-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "地形第十",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "知吾卒之可以擊，而不知敵之不可擊，勝之半也；知敵之可擊，而不知吾卒之不可以擊，勝"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#11-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九地第十一",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡用兵之法，有散地，有輕地，有爭地，有交地，有衢地，有重地，有圮地，有圍"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#11-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九地第十一",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "所謂古之善用兵者，能使敵人前後不相及，衆寡不相恃，貴賤不相救，上下不相收，卒離而"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#11-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九地第十一",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "凡為客之道，深入則專，主人不克。掠于饒野，三軍足食。謹養而勿勞，併氣積力，運兵計"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#11-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九地第十一",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故善用兵者，譬如率然。率然者，常山之蛇也。擊其首則尾至，擊其尾則首至，擊其中則首"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#11-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九地第十一",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "將軍之事，靜以幽，正以治。能愚士卒之耳目，使之無知；易其事，革其謀，使人無識；易"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#11-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九地第十一",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "凡為客之道，深則專，淺則散。去國越境而師者，絕地也；四達者，衢地也；入深者，重地"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#11-p07",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九地第十一",
      "para_index": 7
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "是故不知諸侯之謀者，不能豫交；不知山林、險阻、沮澤之形者，不能行軍；不用鄉導者，"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#11-p08",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "九地第十一",
      "para_index": 8
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "是故政舉之日，夷關折符，無通其使；厲於廊廟之上，以誅其事。敵人開闔，必亟入之，先"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#12-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "火攻第十二",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡火攻有五：一曰火人，二曰火積，三曰火輜，四曰火庫，五曰火隊。行火必有因"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#12-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "火攻第十二",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "凡火攻，必因五火之變而應之：火發於內，則早應之於外；火發而其兵靜者，待而勿攻，極"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#12-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "火攻第十二",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "夫戰勝攻取，而不修其功者凶，命曰「費留」。故曰：明主慮之，良將修之，非利不動，非"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#13-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "用間第十三",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡興師十萬，出征千里，百姓之費，公家之奉，日費千金，內外騷動，怠于道路，"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#13-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "用間第十三",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故用間有五：有鄉間，有內間，有反間，有死間，有生間。五間俱起，莫知其道，是謂「神"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#13-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "用間第十三",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故三軍之事，莫親於間，賞莫厚於間，事莫密於間，非聖智不能用間，非仁義不能使間，非"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#13-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "用間第十三",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "凡軍之所欲擊，城之所欲攻，人之所欲殺，必先知其守將、左右、謁者、門者、舍人之姓名"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#13-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "用間第十三",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "昔殷之興也，伊摯在夏；周之興也，呂牙在殷。故明君賢將，能以上智為間者，必成大功。"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "「吳王謂子胥、孫武曰：『始子言郢不可入，今果何如？』二將曰：『夫戰，借勝以成其威"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「散地士卒顧家，不可與戰，則必固守不出。若敵攻我小城，掠吾田野，禁"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「吾至輕地，始入敵境，士卒思還，難進易退，未背險阻，三軍恐懼，大將"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「爭地，敵先至，據要保利，簡兵練卒，或出或守，以備我奇，則如之何？"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「交地，吾將絶敵，令不得來，必全吾邊城，修其所備，深絶通道，固其隘"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「衢地必先，吾道遠，發後，雖馳車驟馬，至不能先，則如之何？」武曰："
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p07",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 7
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「吾引兵深入重地，多所逾越，糧道絶塞，設欲歸還，勢不可過，欲食於敵"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p08",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 8
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「吾入圮地，山川險阻，難從之道，行久卒勞，敵在吾前，而伏吾後，營居"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p09",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 9
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「吾入圍地，前有強敵，後有險難，敵絶糧道，利我走勢，敵鼓噪不進，以"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p10",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 10
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "又問曰：「敵在吾圍，伏而深謀，示我以利，縈我以旗，紛紛若亂，不知所之，奈何？」武"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p11",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 11
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "又曰：「軍入敵境，敵人固壘不戰，士卒思歸，欲退且難，謂之輕地。當選驍騎伏要路，我"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p12",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 12
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「吾師出境，軍於敵人之地，敵人大至，圍我數重。欲突以出，四塞不通，"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p13",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 13
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「敵勇不懼，驕而無虞，兵眾而強，圖之奈何？」武曰：「詘而待之，以順"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p14",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 14
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "吳王問孫武曰：「敵人保據山險，擅利而處之，糧食又足，挑之則不出，乘間則侵掠，為之"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p15",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 15
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：「將者︰智也，仁也，敬也，信也，勇也，嚴也。」是故智以折敵，仁以附衆，敬"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p16",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 16
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "《孫子占》曰：「三軍將行，其旌旗從容以向前，是為天送，必亟擊之，得其大將。三軍將"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#14-p17",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "答話",
      "para_index": 17
    },
    "psych_domains": null,
    "discourse_mode": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "又按︰《北堂書鈔》引《孫子兵法》云︰「貴之而無驕，委之而不專，扶之而無隱，危之而"
  }
]
